  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845866,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## James Bond 007: From Russia with Love (PlayStation 2)\n\nRelive the iconic 1963 film in *James Bond 007: From Russia with Love* for PlayStation 2, a thrilling third-person shooter that expands upon the classic story. Step into the shoes of Sean Connery’s legendary 007 as he navigates a perilous mission to rescue the Prime Minister’s daughter and thwart a sinister plot orchestrated by the shadowy organization OCTOPUS (a replacement for the legally restricted SPECTRE).\n\nExperience a blend of intense gunplay, exhilarating vehicle chases (including the iconic Aston Martin DB5 and speedboats), and strategic gadget usage, all while immersing yourself in the authentic 1960s atmosphere. Utilize Q Branch’s ingenious devices, like the rappelling gun, laser wristwatch, and sonic cufflinks, to overcome obstacles and dispatch enemies. Featuring Connery’s likeness and voice acting, alongside appearances from deceased actors like Robert Shaw and Desmond Llewelyn, this game delivers a respectful tribute to the formative years of James Bond. Unlockable concept art and behind-the-scenes content further enhance the experience. Engage in offline multiplayer for added replayability."
    },
